cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Lineage of Karate and Taekwondo"
message: "If you use this dataset or visualisation, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Guni
    given-names: Ahmad
    affiliation: "Institute of Global Health Innovation, Imperial College London"
abstract: >-
  A source-checked instructor-to-student cladogram of karate, kobudo and
  taekwondo: 1,459 people, 1,881 links, 388 styles and 493 kata across
  nineteen generations. Every link is graded by evidence strength and carries
  its sources; contested claims are recorded as contested.
keywords:
  - karate
  - taekwondo
  - kobudo
  - lineage
  - martial arts history
  - Okinawa
